  "description": "Frey EX Pro is a full suspension electric mountain bike equipped with the powerful Bafang M620 motor system, which provides a peak power of 1500W. The long range ebike features a dual battery system, providing a maximum capacity of 1344Wh, allowing you to easily tackle long-distance rides and adventures.\n\nFrame\n6061#alloy, 27.5 Trail Geometry, full bearings, 160mm travel\n\nAs the powerful electric bike in Frey, Frey EX boasts those features:\n\nDual batteries: With the integration of dual batteries, Frey EX offers 1344WH capacity and extended range, ensuring you never run out of power on your thrilling journeys.\n\nSafety and Comfort: Ride with confidence and peace of mind, thanks to our full suspension system that guarantees exceptional safety, stability, and comfort.\n\nSuper Convenience: Effortlessly charge your bike with the detachable backpack battery, designed for maximum convenience. With Frey EX, you're always ready to hit the trails and explore the great outdoors.\n\nMAXXIS Tires: Equipped with rugged and long-lasting MAXXIS tires, Frey EX ensures superior traction and slip resistance, allowing you to confidently navigate any terrain.\n\n- Click here to see the process and cost of shipping. Please CHECK THE LINK before you place the order.\n- All frequently-asked questions are listed on our FAQ page.",
